# func/text/tx_len (id 312): LEN core. A = text (2, handle) or error. Result A = (1, length) or the error.
# PC 0: error -> return unchanged; text -> read [handle], next self PC 1. PC 1: A = (1, x0), return (LR, LP).
# Note: weights/func/text/tx_len.md
